===Etymology 2===
{{suffix|urban|ity}} (later than “courtesy” sense).

====Noun====
{{en-noun|urbanit|ies}}

# What is [[characteristically]] [[urban]] in an area; [[urbanness]].
#* '''1955''', C.J. Lammers, ''Studies in Holland flood disaster 1953'', vol. 2, [http://books.google.ca/books?id=_DcrAAAAYAAJ&vq=urbanity&pg=PA39 p. 39],
